"""Layer-0 MLP down_proj, component 5159: a chat-template marker detector.

Almost always silent. It responds to a few special tokens of the chat template:
<|im_start|> is strongly negative when it opens a document (the first token of a
packed document), mildly positive mid-document; </think> is strongly negative;
<tool_call> is mildly negative and </tool_call> mildly positive. Everything else
is predicted as 0.
